[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306D\u3048\u3001\u305D\u308D\u305D\u308D\u59CB\u307E\u308B\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, looks like it\u0027s about to start!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u5973\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u90FD\u3067\u6B4C\u59EB\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u6B4C\u304C\u805E\u3051\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\n\u5922\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can\u0027t believe we get to hear the songstress Diona perform here in the capital. It\u0027s like a dream!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u7537\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6E96\u5099\u306F\u3044\u3044\u304B\u3057\u3089\u3001\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you ready, Diona?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3001\u30E9\u30E9\u69D8\u3002\u6700\u9AD8\u306E\u72B6\u614B\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, Lady Lara. Everything is perfect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u30E9\u30E9\u30FB\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u30C0\u30E0\u3068\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u738B\u56FD\u306E\u53CB\u597D\u3092\n\u8A18\u5FF5\u3057\u3066\u62AB\u9732\u3059\u308B\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u306E\u50AC\u3057\u7269",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This celebration at the Starbirth Festival commemorates the friendship between the Lara Kingdom and Lantarna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3073\u3063\u304D\u308A\u306E\u6B4C\u3092\u62AB\u9732\u3057\u3066\u3001\u30E9\u30E9\u30FB\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u30C0\u30E0\u306E\n\u5A01\u5149\u3092\u793A\u3059\u306E\u3067\u3059\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let us demonstrate the glory of the Lara Kingdom with an extraordinary performance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u4EFB\u305B\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3042\u3001\u7686\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u4F55\u3088\u308A\u3060\u3002\n\u30E9\u30E9\u3068\u8A71\u3092\u4ED8\u3051\u305F\u7532\u6590\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I\u0027m glad to see everyone\u0027s so excited. It was worth working things out with Lara."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u968E\u6BB5\u3092\u30B9\u30C6\u30FC\u30B8\u306B\u3059\u308B\u306A\u3069\u524D\u4EE3\u672A\u805E\u3067\u306F\u3042\u3063\u305F\u304C\u3001\n\u5927\u304D\u306A\u6DF7\u4E71\u3082\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Using the grand staircase as a stage is unprecedented, but there doesn\u0027t seem to be any major confusion."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8272\u3005\u624B\u914D\u611F\u8B1D\u3059\u308B\u3088\u3002\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u4ECA\u56DE\u306E\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u3082\n\u8CD1\u308F\u3044\u305D\u3046\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks for handling all the arrangements. Looks like this Starbirth Festival will be quite lively."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u611F\u8B1D\u3060\u305C\uFF01\u3000\u307E\u3055\u304B\u6B4C\u59EB\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u751F\u6B4C\u3092\n\u805E\u3051\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3088\uFF01\u3000\u3084\u308B\u3058\u3083\u306D\u3048\u304B\u5805\u7269\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We really owe you one! Who\u0027d have thought we\u0027d get to hear Diona sing live! Not bad for a stickler!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u541B\u3082\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You must be looking forward to it too, Juna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3001\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3088\u308A\u3001\u7DCA\u5F35\u304C\u5F37\u3044\u3067\u3059\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I\u0027m more nervous than excited..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u3084\u306F\u308A\u79C1\u306F\u3001\u3053\u3093\u306A\u683C\u597D\u3092\u3059\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u306F\n\u7121\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, I still don\u0027t think this outfit was really necessary..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3044\u3060\u308D\uFF1F\n\u4ECA\u56DE\u306E\u4E3B\u5F79\u306F\u30E6\u30CA\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don\u0027t say that! You\u0027re one of the stars of the show too, you know!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u305F\u3093\u304C\u4ECA\u591C\u62AB\u9732\u3059\u308B\u6B4C\u306F\u3001\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u5927\u597D\u304D\u30E6\u30CA\u306E\u5192\u967A\u8B5A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The song Diona\u0027s performing tonight is all about everyone\u0027s beloved Juna\u0027s adventures!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u65B0\u4F5C\u306E\u62AB\u9732\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u7740\u98FE\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3068\uFF01\n\u3044\u3084\u3042\u3001\u6211\u306A\u304C\u3089\u826F\u3044\u670D\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u306A\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s a brand new piece, so you have to dress for the occasion! I must say, I outdid myself with this outfit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u3068\u306E\u5408\u4F5C\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF1F\n\u4F3C\u5408\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3088\u3001\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s a collaboration between you and Diona, right? It suits you well, Juna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u3042\u307E\u308A\u898B\u306A\u3044\u3067\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01\n\u79C1\u306E\u670D\u306A\u3069\u3069\u3046\u3067\u3082\u3044\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "P-please don\u0027t stare! My clothes aren\u0027t important!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u65B0\u4F5C\u306E\u5192\u967A\u8B5A\u304B\u3042\u3002\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306A\u6B4C\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of the new tale of adventure... Juna, what kind of song is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u77E5\u3089\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3060\u3002\u5148\u65E5\u307E\u305F\u5BC6\u7740\u53D6\u6750\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u3066\u3044\u305F\n\u306E\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026\u5B8C\u6210\u5F62\u3092\u6559\u3048\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3063\u3066\u3044\u306A\u304F\u3066\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t know either. They did interview me recently, but... they haven\u0027t let me hear the finished piece."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u305F\u3061\u306F\u6B8B\u5FF5\u3060\u306A\u3042\u3002\n\u3053\u306E\u8A18\u5FF5\u3059\u3079\u304D\u65B0\u4F5C\u3092\u805E\u3051\u306A\u3044\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Too bad for Resna and the others. Missing out on this historic new piece..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F7C\u5973\u305F\u3061\u306F\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u4F5C\u308A\u304C\u5FD9\u3057\u3044\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3067\u306D\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3069\u3093\u306A\u5185\u5BB9\u3060\u3063\u305F\u304B\u306F\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u304C\u4F1D\u3048\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3088\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They\u0027re busy making presents, it seems... We\u0027ll have to tell them all about it later."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3002\u6570\u3005\u306E\u7ADC\u3092\u8A0E\u4F10\u3057\u305F\u3001\n\u3000\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u82F1\u96C4\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna, Knight of the Midnight Sun. Hero of Lantarna who has slain countless dragons.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5F37\u304F\u901E\u3057\u3044\u5B58\u5728\u3068\u3057\u3066\u79C1\u306F\u3053\u308C\u307E\u3067\n\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3092\u6B4C\u3063\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3002\u3067\u3082\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Until now, I\u0027ve always sung of Juna as a strong and mighty figure. But...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u65C5\u3092\u5171\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u521D\u3081\u3066\u898B\u3048\u3066\u304D\u305F\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u59FF\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Traveling together has shown me a different side of her...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u3053\u308C\u3092\u3001\u7686\u306B\u5C4A\u3051\u308B\u3002\n\u3000\u3053\u308C\u304C\u6B4C\u59EB\u3067\u3042\u308B\u79C1\u306E\u4F7F\u547D\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Today, I\u0027ll share this with everyone. This is my duty as a songstress.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u306F\u3001\u805E\u3044\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\n\u300E\u771F\u306A\u308B\u82F1\u96C4\u300F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, please listen to \u0027True Hero.\u0027"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u307E\u308A\u30D0\u30B7\u30D0\u30B7\u3068\u53E9\u304F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don\u0027t clap too hard now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]